  <p style="font-size:8.5pt; color:#5B6272; margin:0 0 16px;">Security of Payment legislation also exists in all other States and Territories — VIC: BCISP Act 2002; QLD: BIF Act 2017; SA: BCISP Act 2009; WA: CWAS Act 2004; ACT: BCISP Act 2009; TAS: BCISP Act 2009; NT: CJS Act 2004. Where the Site is located outside NSW, the equivalent legislation applies.</p>

